{comment: Verse 1}
At Your [B]Name, the mountains shake and [E]crumble
At Your [B]Name, the oceans roar and [E]tumble
At Your [F#]Name, angles will [G#m]bow the earth will [E]rejoice
Your people cry out[F#]

{comment: Chorus}
[B]Lord of all the earth,
we shout your name, shout your name
[G#m]Filling up the skies,
with endless praise, endless praise
[F#]Yahweh, Yahweh,
We [E]love to shout your name
Oh [B]Lord [C#m] [G#m] [E] [B] [C#m] [G#m] [F#]

{comment: Verse 2}
At Your [B]Name, the morning breaks in gl[E]ory
